Maintainer: Sahil Patki <161210761+sahil-mpatki@users.noreply.github.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: shellos-kernel-tools
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, linux-perf, llvm-19, sudo, curl, python3
Recommends: shellos-autofdo
Description: personal profile-guided optimisation for the ShellOS kernel
 shellos-kernel-profile samples the running kernel with Intel LBR and turns
 the result into AutoFDO and Propeller profiles that the ShellOS kernel
 build consumes, so the kernel is optimised for how this machine is used.
